cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this package in your work, please cite the paper below.
  CITATION.bib has BibTeX entries for it and for the paper that introduced the
  method.
type: software
title: ODEParameterEstimation.jl
abstract: >-
  ODEParameterEstimation.jl fits the parameters and initial conditions of an
  ordinary differential equation model to time-series data. It solves
  polynomial equations built from the model and from derivatives of the data,
  so it needs no starting guesses, returns every parameter set that fits when
  there is more than one, and reports which parameters the data cannot
  determine.
